#: ../../about/versioning.md:1
#: c4d2b0b974704b119e8be7d7fa50ae10
msgid "Versioning & algorithm tracking"
msgstr "Versionéierung & Verfollegung vum Algorithmus"

#: ../../about/versioning.md:3
#: 5b3a07a890104503b4dc53ad0daf9dd5
msgid "parsecore follows [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/)."
msgstr "parsecore follegt der [semantescher Versionéierung](https://semver.org/)."

#: ../../about/versioning.md:5
#: fd0510f5a11b44a39751d59048f272e4
msgid "Algorithm updates"
msgstr "Algorithmus-Aktualiséierungen"

#: ../../about/versioning.md:7
#: e31ad9ccccab4fa88d16939bc224e563
msgid "parsecore tracks the **official osu! difficulty and performance algorithm**. When ppy deploys a pp/star-rating rework, parsecore is updated to match the new deploy and the parity suite is re-run to confirm bit-exactness."
msgstr "parsecore verfollegt den **offiziellen osu!-Algorithmus fir d'Schwieregkeets- an d'Performanceberechnung**. Wann ppy e pp-/Star-Rating-Rework ausrullt, gëtt parsecore aktualiséiert, fir dem neien Deploy ze entspriechen, an d'Paritéitssuite gëtt nach eng Kéier ausgefouert, fir d'Bitgenauegkeet ze bestätegen."

#: ../../about/versioning.md:11
#: 73c06271aa3b440fb880ab167185e99b
msgid "The current target is the **2026 Q2 rework**, osu! deploy **`2026.702.1`**."
msgstr "Dat aktuellt Zil ass de **2026 Q2-Rework**, osu!-Deploy **2026.702.1**."

#: ../../about/versioning.md:14
#: af3bcb130f5a4f4987008f6823aa4318
msgid "Because parsecore follows the official algorithm directly, its values can differ from third-party calculators or the osu! website in the days after a rework those are often still recalculating or running an older algorithm. Values for newly set in-game scores are the source of truth."
msgstr "Well parsecore dem offiziellen Algorithmus direkt follegt, kënne seng Wäerter an den Deeg no engem Rework vun Drëttubidder-Rechneren oder der osu!-Websäit ofwäichen, well dës dacks nach ëmmer nei berechnen oder en eeleren Algorithmus benotzen. D'Wäerter vun nei am Spill erzielte Scores sinn déi massgeeblech Referenz."

#: ../../about/versioning.md:20
#: 5b426dec82584d1ca5cb033f7f6405b5
msgid "Python support"
msgstr "Python-Ënnerstëtzung"

#: ../../about/versioning.md:22
#: 5c5f3174607f47e782386c5f6ab817bf
msgid "parsecore supports **Python 3.10, 3.11, 3.12 and 3.13**."
msgstr "parsecore ënnerstëtzt **Python 3.10, 3.11, 3.12 an 3.13**."

